  "notes": [
    "Exact pin of owner-published local bundle 0.2.0-rc.3 — VDB Digital 2.0 remains CANONICAL_BACKEND_OWNER.",
    "Mobile 0.1.1 / 2026.07.24.remediation was a local remediation proposal only and is NOT canonical.",
    "Owner 0.1.0 freeze is historical only and is NOT the staging target.",
    "Canonical tables are portal_* + partner_*; Mobile must use client mapping (see namingAliases / rpcNames.mobileClientRpcMapping).",
    "Financial flags remain fail-closed (mollie_checkout, digital_product_checkout, partner_payouts).",
    "schemaVersion 2026.07.27.financial-concurrency-rc2 included partner sale UNIQUE(partner_lead_id) and payout liability serialization; clients must still handle PARTNER_LEAD_ALREADY_CONVERTED and PARTNER_INSUFFICIENT_LIABILITY.",
    "schemaVersion 2026.07.25.messaging-support-appointments-rc3 activates portal_conversations/portal_messages/portal_support_tickets/portal_support_replies/portal_appointments live queries for Mobile; conversations/support/appointments are no longer CONTRACT_SURFACE_UNAVAILABLE.",
    "Mobile must filter is_internal=false client-side (defense in depth) when reading portal_messages/portal_support_replies as a customer, and must never call internal-note RPCs from customer flows.",
    "appointments_booking, messaging_realtime and support_internal_notes_rpc remain fail-closed (false) until the owner enables them; booking/cancel/reschedule surface FEATURE_DISABLED as a configuration error instead of failing hard, and listing appointments must keep working.",
    "availability_slots does not exist in rc.3 — listAvailableSlots always returns an empty list rather than reporting the surface unavailable.",
    "Local supabase/migrations in this repo remain NON-CANONICAL proposal SQL for isolated Mobile proof only."
  ],
